OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a wet and cloudy start on
OL,6,FWednesday, it turns drier and brighter
OL,7,Ffor most, with some low cloud
OL,8,Flingering in central areas. Light
OL,9,Fwinds and temperatures near normal.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny lingering cloud tends to
OL,12,Fclear tonight, with a cold night ahead
OL,13,Fallowing for mist and fog patches to
OL,14,Fform and a frost.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FAfter any mist clears,
OL,17,FThursday will be dry with plenty of
OL,18,Fautumnal sunshine. Feeling cold for
OL,19,Fthe time of year with a breeze towards
OL,20,FPembrokeshire and a widespread frost
OL,21,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
