OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FPlenty
OL,6,Fof sunshine on Friday, but it turns
OL,7,Fcloudier on Saturday while remaining
OL,8,Fdry and cold throughout, with
OL,9,Fwidespread overnight frosts. It turns
OL,10,Fmilder and damper on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
